n modern hardwareThree graphics modes: DOS (the original DOS 1994 release), Windows 95 (based on the 1997 re-release) and Software (real-time high resolution render)Switch graphics modes on the fly to compare them in real timeNo GP","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T15:59:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695833","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4834840-1841579228676387","game_id":"steam-4834840","kind":"announcement","title":"Ecstatica is releasing on October 26th!","summary":"Celebrate Halloween in TirichWe are happy to announce that Ecstatica will be releasing on October 26th, alongisde its sequel - Ecstatica II. Just before Halloween - the right time to return to a village where everything wants you dead, often in gruesome ways. This is a perfect opportunity to experience this cult survival-horror once again - or for the first time. The re-release makes sure the game runs smoothly on modern systems, and adds several improvements, including full controller support.T","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-24T18:52:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228676387","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4834840-1837955055364467","game_id":"steam-4834840","kind":"announcement","title":"Ecstatica is coming back!","summary":"Dear horror enthusiasts!We are happy to announce that in Q4 2026 we will re-release Ecstatica, a cult survival horror classic. Developed by Andrew Spencer Studios and released in 1994, it's known for its pioneering, one-of-a-kind ellipsoid graphics and for combining gory horror with British humour. Around the same time, we will also re-release Ecstatica II, a more action-oriented sequel from the same studio.The re-release will focus on making sure the game runs smoothly on modern systems. We'll ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-13T21:02:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055364467","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4834840":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:37Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:37Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4834840":"2026-10-26T14:31:37Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4834840":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:37Z"},"5307880":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:37Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4834840","app_id":4834840,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:00Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"cb26b167d71ea41c717694a6b58260ed931dd93ffebb34b298c9a57e57043ce5","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Ecstatica is a pioneering survival-horror adventure set in the demon-cursed medieval village of Tirich. Explore a world rendered entirely from ellipsoids, sneak past or fight off nightmarish creatures, solve puzzles, and lift the curse.","publishers":[{"name":"SNEG","creator_clan_account_id":45236248}],"developers":[{"name":"Andrew Spencer Studios"}],"franchises":[{"name":"Ecstatica"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793037600,"is_c